# Canonicalize commit identities to the project's organization address.
#
# This file previously carried a mapping from a personal commit email to
# opensource@nervosys.ai. The mapping was removed on 2026-08-27 because it was
# self-defeating: git's mailmap syntax requires naming the address you want
# hidden, so the file published the very address it was canonicalizing — in a
# public repository.
#
# Removing it costs nothing here. Verified before the change: every author and
# committer email across all refs is already opensource@nervosys.ai
# (`git log --all --format='%ae%n%ce' | sort -u`), so the mapping applied to no
# commit in this repository.
nervosys <opensource@nervosys.ai>
